    2-emit-partition (a): dissolve orch_run env weld into structured EnvPrefixed/EnvUnset AST (#6137)
    
    * WIP: 2-emit-partition — shell/json/yaml as grammar rows, zero language knowle
    
    * WIP: 2-emit-partition — shell/json/yaml as grammar rows, zero language knowle
    
    * 2-emit-partition (a): dissolve orch_run env weld into structured EnvPrefixed/EnvUnset AST
    
    Route env-bearing orchestration Run emission through the #5868 structured
    bash_stmt_env_prefixed / bash_stmt_env_unset grammar builders instead of the
    opaque single-orch_raw welded render. The medium now returns an OrchRunEmitPlan
    (construct_tag + target) so env-shape dispatch lives entirely in extdeps; the
    compiler stage stays a fully agnostic registry-dispatch fold. Drops the
    met-condition orch_run_env_reduction_dissolution_trigger scaffold + its
    recording witness. Byte-identical output preserved (single EnvSet and
    multi-binding+EnvUnset retry paths).
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
    
    * wip: targeted orch env verify plan (throwaway)
    
    * add structured bash_stmt_env_unset production (env -u NAME command)
    
    * wip: split verify plan into per-file batches
    
    * wip: skip=true to match real floor resolution
    
    * remove throwaway verification plan
    
    ---------
    
    Co-authored-by: Brian Searls <briansearls1@gmail.com>
